<section class="command-section" id="commands"><div class="wrap"><div class="command-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Ask Stonefellow</div><h2 class="section-title">Operate the session with natural language.</h2><p>Use voice or text for project actions that already exist in the Stonefellow workflow. Click an example to see the kind of response the assistant should give.</p></div><div class="command-grid"><button class="command-card is-active" type="button" data-command-reply="Created a new project at 103 BPM and opened it in the Stem Studio."><span>PROJECT</span><strong>“Create a new project at 103 BPM.”</strong></button><button class="command-card" type="button" data-command-reply="Added four empty vocal tracks and left their input assignments ready for selection."><span>TRACKS</span><strong>“Add four empty vocal tracks.”</strong></button><button class="command-card" type="button" data-command-reply="Bass is muted. I kept the rest of the mix unchanged."><span>MIX</span><strong>“Mute the bass.”</strong></button><button class="command-card" type="button" data-command-reply="Looping measures 4 through 10. Playback will stay inside that range until you clear the loop."><span>TRANSPORT</span><strong>“Loop measures 4 through 10.”</strong></button><button class="command-card" type="button" data-command-reply="Loaded the most recent saved version of the current project and restored its track state."><span>PROJECT</span><strong>“Load the latest project version.”</strong></button><button class="command-card" type="button" data-command-reply="The latest changes are Mix v4, a 1.5 dB bass reduction, one vocal approval, and two release tasks still open."><span>MEMORY</span><strong>“What changed since yesterday?”</strong></button></div><div class="command-response" aria-live="polite"><div class="command-response-icon">S</div><div><b>Stonefellow</b><p id="commandReply">Created a new project at 103 BPM and opened it in the Stem Studio.</p></div></div></div></section>
